auto px-6 py-12\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-amber-100 mb-8 text-center\">Menu Andalan Kami</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><div class=\"p-5 bg-[#181310] border border-[#2d241d] rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-between\"><div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-amber-100 text-base\">Kopi Susu Gula Aren Asli</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-[#8c7e71] mt-0.5\">Espresso blend, susu segar, dan gula aren organik cair.</p></div><span class=\"text-amber-400 font-bold text-sm shrink-0 ml-4\">Rp 22.000</span></div><div class=\"p-5 bg-[#181310] border border-[#2d241d] rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-between\"><div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-amber-100 text-base\">Caramel Macchiato Chill</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-[#8c7e71] mt-0.5\">Sentuhan karamel manis gurih dengan foam susu lembut.</p></div><span class=\"text-amber-400 font-bold text-sm shrink-0 ml-4\">Rp 28.000</span></div><div class=\"p-5 bg-[#181310] border border-[#2d241d] rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-between\"><div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-amber-100 text-base\">Manual Brew V60 Flores Bajawa</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-[#8c7e71] mt-0.5\">Single origin dengan aroma floral, citrus, dan body seimbang.</p></div><span class=\"text-amber-400 font-bold text-sm shrink-0 ml-4\">Rp 25.000</span></div><div class=\"p-5 bg-[#181310] border border-[#2d241d] rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-between\"><div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-amber-100 text-base\">Croissant Cokelat Mentega</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-[#8c7e71] mt-0.5\">Pastry renyah butter Prancis dengan lelehan cokelat Belgia.</p></div><span class=\"text-amber-400 font-bold text-sm shrink-0 ml-4\">Rp 24.000</span></div></div></section><footer class=\"border-t border-[#2d241d] mt-16 py-6 text-center text-xs text-[#73665a]\"><p>© 2026 Kopi Senja & Eatery. Powered by vimos.ai</p></footer></body></html>",
